 role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semialgebra}_S(S,R,n)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file is a legacy-name alias. The upstream definition supplies the real-closed field, ambient dimension, and finite Boolean combination explicitly.</li>\n<li>Tarski-Seidenberg: semialgebraic sets are closed under projections; definable</li>\n<li>Cell decomposition: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> partitions into cells (intervals, points) definable semialgebraically</li>\n<li>o-minimal: expansions of real field making all semialgebraic sets form o-minimal structure</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bochnak, Coste and Roy, Real Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>van den Dries, Tame Topology and O-Minimal Structures</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c36cc156fef49a61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c36cc156fef49a61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,R,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semialgebra}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{Semialgebra}_S(S,R,n)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-semialgebra.md|58-df-semialgebra]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["c36cc156fef49a61"]}